{"seq":2,"slug":"core-contributions","title":"苏格拉底·core-contributions","stage":"DONE","category":"socrates","categoryLabel":"苏格拉底","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/core-contributions","rating":{"composite":3.78,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/20_socrates/2_core-contributions","introHtml":"<p>苏格拉底（约公元前 470—前 399 年）对西方思想的核心贡献，奠定了整个西方哲学的根基。本部分系统呈现三组划时代的贡献，揭示他何以被尊为「西方哲学之父」：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>哲学转向</strong>——他完成了把哲学从「自然」转向「人」的伟大转向（<a href=\"turning-philosophy/from-nature-to-man\">从自然到人</a>），并由此开创西方伦理学（<a href=\"turning-philosophy/the-birth-of-ethics\">伦理学的诞生</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>方法奠基</strong>——他创立诘问反驳法（<a href=\"founding-method/the-socratic-method\">苏格拉底方法</a>），并把对普遍定义的追求确立为知识的标靶（<a href=\"founding-method/definition-and-concept\">定义与概念</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>谱系源头</strong>——他作为柏拉图之师成为西方哲学主流谱系的源头（<a href=\"source-of-philosophy/teacher-of-plato\">柏拉图之师</a>），其众多弟子又开创了多支小苏格拉底学派（<a href=\"source-of-philosophy/the-socratic-schools\">苏格拉底学派</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>本 hub 回答「苏格拉底<strong>贡献了什么</strong>（对哲学史的客观奠基作用）」，与同级其他 hub 分工如下，避免重复：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>兄弟 hub</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>他是谁、经历了什么</td>\n<td>本 hub 不叙生平，只谈贡献</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>他<strong>主张什么</strong>（自知无知、美德即知识、省察的人生等思想内容）</td>\n<td>本 hub 谈这些贡献的<strong>奠基地位</strong>，思想内容的细致阐发在彼</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">重要著作</a></td>\n<td>他不著一字、史料如何构成（柏拉图/色诺芬/阿里斯托芬）</td>\n<td>本 hub 引用这些文本作论据，不专论史料学</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>古代至当代的后世影响</td>\n<td>本 hub 限于直接的哲学奠基与谱系，长程影响在彼</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>苏格拉底问题、是否有罪、总体评判</td>\n<td>本 hub 仅在涉及贡献评价处带出争议，专论在彼</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「思想与方法」与本 hub 最易混淆：记忆口诀是——<strong>「思想与方法」讲教义内容，「核心贡献」讲历史奠基</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径与前置\">推荐学习路径与前置</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>前置知识</strong>：建议先读兄弟 hub <a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a> 了解雅典背景与苏格拉底其人；无哲学基础者可同时参考前苏格拉底哲学常识。</li>\n<li><strong>本 hub 内阅读顺序</strong>：按 1 → 2 → 3 章节顺序最佳。先理解「转向」这一总纲（章节 1），再看转向落实为何种方法（章节 2），最后看方法与思想如何经谱系传承（章节 3）。</li>\n<li><strong>延伸</strong>：读完本 hub 后，转向 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a> 深化教义内容，或转向 <a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a> 了解后世回响。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"turning-philosophy","title":"Turning Philosophy","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/core-contributions/turning-philosophy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"from-nature-to-man","title":"从自然到人","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/core-contributions/turning-philosophy/from-nature-to-man"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-birth-of-ethics","title":"伦理学的诞生","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/core-contributions/turning-philosophy/the-birth-of-ethics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"founding-method","title":"Founding Method","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/core-contributions/founding-method","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-socratic-method","title":"苏格拉底方法","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/core-contributions/founding-method/the-socratic-method"},{"seq":2,"slug":"definition-and-concept","title":"定义与概念","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/core-contributions/founding-method/definition-and-concept"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"source-of-philosophy","title":"Source Of Philosophy","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/core-contributions/source-of-philosophy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"teacher-of-plato","title":"柏拉图之师","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/core-contributions/source-of-philosophy/teacher-of-plato"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-socratic-schools","title":"苏格拉底学派","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/core-contributions/source-of-philosophy/the-socratic-schools"}]}]}